<title>FINLAND: NOKIAN RENKAAT JAN-APRIL PROFIT UP 8 PCT.</title>
<headline>NOKIAN RENKAAT JAN-APRIL PROFIT UP 8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   30.3 vs 28.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.90 vs 1.87</p>
<p> Net sales					  339.8 vs 339.5</p>
<p> Operating profit				  35.0 vs 33.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of five forecasts in a Reuters poll for</p>
<p>Finnish tyre maker Nokian Renkaat profit before extraordinary</p>
<p>items and tax had been 33 mln markka (range 24-37 mln markka).</p>
</text>
